:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Beefcake Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Actress Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] and is sold for 150 [[Cat Food]] once clearing [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] in the [[Empire of Cats]] chapter 2. She gains her [[True Form]] in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] which increases health and attack speed. Along with the rest of the purchasable Special Cats, she received [[Talents]] in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], she becomes obtainable when clearing Iwate in chapter 2 and costs 17000 XP. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she is purchasable for 75 Cat Food once clearing [[Mongolia (Into the Future)|Mongolia]] from [[Into the Future]].

