==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Actress Cat was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Cover Girl (Removed Combo)|Cover Girl]] and [[Baby on Board (Removed Combo)|Baby on Board]].
*Actress Cat, Salon Cat,  Paris Cat and Mother Cat will aesthetically fit [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]]; Beefcake Cat will do the same with Macho Leg Cat.
*Mother Cat appears to be the mother of kittens with hind legs, despite not having any herself.
*Actress Cat is one of the only two purchasable Special Cats that has their health increased in True Form, the other one being [[Bondage Cat (Special Cat)|Ultimate Bondage Cat]].
*The true form of Actress Cat, as with the rest of the purchasable Special Cats, exists within the data [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], but cannot be obtained in regular gameplay. If obtained via outside means (such as through save file modification), it can be used and functions normally.
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Actress Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Actress Cat
Maintains a high level of professionalism.
Works very well with Sexy Legs Cat.
Exceptional Area Attack power and range.</pre>
<pre>Mother Cat
Her love is limitless!
Works very well with Sexy Legs Cat.
Exceptional Area Attack power and range.</pre>
<pre>Beefcake Cat
Dominated the bareknuckle boxing circuit with
long distance Area Attacks. Paired with legs
that float like a butterfly, really stings like a bee!</pre>
**Beefcake Cat's description referenced the first half of the famous quote from professional boxer [[wikipedia:Muhammad Ali|Muhammad Ali]]: ''"Float like a butterfly, sting like a bee. The hands can't hit what the eyes can't see."''

